WEBVTT

00:07.833 --> 00:09.133
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.133 --> 00:10.933
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.933 --> 00:12.400
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.400 --> 00:14.567
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.567 --> 00:17.400
- * Ohh...
- * 哦...

00:17.400 --> 00:19.500
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.500 --> 00:21.500
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.500 --> 00:23.400
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.400 --> 00:25.033
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.033 --> 00:27.533
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.533 --> 00:29.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.367 --> 00:31.467
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.467 --> 00:33.500
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.500 --> 00:35.367
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.367 --> 00:37.700
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.700 --> 00:39.633
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.633 --> 00:40.967
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:42.833
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.833 --> 00:45.567
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.567 --> 00:47.867
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:47.867 --> 00:49.400
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.867 --> 00:54.867
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:54.867 --> 01:02.933
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:02.933 --> 01:05.067
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

01:05.067 --> 01:06.633
Your turn.
轮到你了。

01:06.633 --> 01:09.100
- Uhmmmm...uhnn.
- 嗯……嗯。

01:09.100 --> 01:12.167
Now you.
现在轮到你。

01:12.167 --> 01:13.300
- Hey, Patrick.
- 嘿，帕特里克。

01:13.300 --> 01:16.133
- [sighs]
Yeah, SpongeBob?
- [叹气]
是啊，海绵宝宝？

01:16.133 --> 01:18.767
Do you think maybe it would make
the game more exciting
你认为也许这会让
游戏更精彩

01:18.767 --> 01:23.633
if we played it with...
two sticks?
如果我们玩...
两根棍子？

01:23.633 --> 01:24.600
- Two sticks?
- 两根棍子？

01:24.600 --> 01:25.900
That's against the rules.
这是违反规则的。

01:25.900 --> 01:28.133
You can't change the rules,
SpongeBob,
你无法改变规则
海绵宝宝，

01:28.133 --> 01:29.567
just because I'm winning.
只是因为我赢了。

01:29.567 --> 01:30.967
- I'm sorry, Patrick.
- 对不起，帕特里克。

01:30.967 --> 01:33.533
I'm just so bored playing stick
and a cup.
我只是无聊地玩棍子
和一个杯子。

01:33.533 --> 01:36.600
- Are you tired of playing with
the old stick and a cup?
- 你玩腻了吗
旧棍子和杯子？

01:36.600 --> 01:38.200
both: Yeah.
两人：是的。

01:38.200 --> 01:41.800
- Well, say good-bye to boring,
and hello to Whirly Brains,
- 好吧，告别无聊，
向旋转大脑问好，

01:41.800 --> 01:44.867
the exciting new toy that puts
you in the driver's seat
令人兴奋的新玩具
你坐在驾驶座上

01:44.867 --> 01:46.467
of your own mind!
你自己的想法！

01:46.467 --> 01:48.433
It's so simple.
Just flip your lid,
就是这么简单。
只要掀开盖子，

01:48.433 --> 01:50.167
attach the propeller,
安装螺旋桨，

01:50.167 --> 01:53.133
and watch your brain soar
hundreds of feet into the air
看着你的大脑翱翔
数百英尺高空

01:53.133 --> 01:55.133
as you control the action.
当你控制动作时。

01:55.133 --> 01:57.867
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

01:57.867 --> 02:00.833
- [gasping]
- [喘气]

02:00.833 --> 02:02.967
both: Ahhhh.
两人：啊啊啊。

02:02.967 --> 02:07.333
- Get your Whirly Brain today,
and free your mind!
- 今天就获得你的旋转大脑，
并释放你的思想！

02:07.333 --> 02:08.933
- Free my mind!
Free my mind!
- 释放我的思想！
解放我的心灵！

02:08.933 --> 02:10.067
Free my mind!
解放我的心灵！

02:10.067 --> 02:12.567
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

02:12.567 --> 02:14.600
both: I want it. I want it.
I want it. No, I want it.
两人：我想要。我要它。
我要它。不，我想要它。

02:14.600 --> 02:17.467
No, it's mine. I want it.
I want it. I want it.
不，这是我的。我要它。
我要它。我要它。

02:18.767 --> 02:22.333
- Sorry to hear about your TV,
SpongeBob.
- 很遗憾听到你的电视的事，
海绵宝宝。

02:22.333 --> 02:25.567
- Whirly Brains are available
now at Bikini Bottom Toy Shop.
- 旋转大脑可用
现在在比基尼泳裤玩具店。

02:25.567 --> 02:27.733
both: Whirly Brains! Whirly
Brains!
两人：旋转的大脑！旋风
脑子！

02:27.733 --> 02:31.567
Whirly Brains! Whirly Brains!
Whirly Brains!
旋转的大脑！旋转的大脑！
旋转的大脑！

02:34.400 --> 02:36.600
- Okay, Patrick, just let me
flip your lid,
- 好吧，帕特里克，让我来吧
掀开你的盖子，

02:36.600 --> 02:39.733
so I can attach the propeller
directly to your brain.
这样我就可以装上螺旋桨
直接到你的大脑。

02:39.733 --> 02:43.200
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

02:43.200 --> 02:44.567
- Buh-ha-ha.
- 哈哈哈。

02:44.567 --> 02:49.933
- Step one...[mutters]...oh, I
see what to do.
- 第一步...[嘀咕]...哦，我
看看该怎么做。

02:49.933 --> 02:51.233
Ahhh!
啊啊！

02:51.233 --> 02:53.500
- Ahhh!
- 啊啊！

02:53.500 --> 02:55.067
- It's just me, Patrick.
- 只有我，帕特里克。

02:55.067 --> 02:57.233
- Ohhh.
- 哦哦。

02:57.233 --> 03:00.233
[exhales]
[呼气]

03:00.233 --> 03:01.467
- Now you do me.
- 现在你做我了。

03:01.467 --> 03:06.400
- Boo!
- Ahhh!
- 嘘！
- 啊啊！

03:06.400 --> 03:10.400
It's time to free our minds.
是时候解放我们的思想了。

03:13.167 --> 03:15.133
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:15.133 --> 03:16.667
Whoa, Patrick.
哇，帕特里克。

03:16.667 --> 03:18.367
I've never seen the world from
this angle before.
我从未见过这个世界
之前这个角度。

03:18.367 --> 03:22.367
- And the propeller tickles my
think folds.
- 螺旋桨让我发痒
认为折叠。

03:22.367 --> 03:24.700
[laughs]
[笑]

03:24.700 --> 03:27.900
Hey. Hey.
Hey, SpongeBob, eye bump.
嘿。嘿。
嘿，海绵宝宝，眼睛肿了。

03:27.900 --> 03:29.067
- Eye bump.
- 眼睛肿块。

03:29.067 --> 03:31.367
Ow!
噢！

03:31.367 --> 03:33.367
Patrick, no more eye bumps,
okay?
帕特里克，不再有眼肿，
好吗？

03:33.367 --> 03:35.433
- I feel you.
- 我感觉到你了。

03:35.433 --> 03:38.367
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

03:38.367 --> 03:46.567
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:50.733 --> 03:52.467
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:52.467 --> 03:54.433
both: Brain freeze!
两人：大脑冻结！

03:54.433 --> 03:59.300
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

03:59.300 --> 04:00.967
- Meow.
- 喵。

04:00.967 --> 04:02.967
[laughter]
[笑声]

04:02.967 --> 04:04.333
- Hey, Patrick.
- 嘿，帕特里克。

04:04.333 --> 04:08.500
* I know who we can spy on
*我知道我们可以监视谁

04:08.500 --> 04:11.733
- Ahh, the sanctity of my
bathroom,
- 啊，我的神圣
浴室,

04:11.733 --> 04:14.567
the only place in the world
where I can
世界上唯一的地方
我可以在哪里

04:14.567 --> 04:17.667
let it all hang out.
让一切都结束吧。

04:17.667 --> 04:22.600
Ahh, me.
啊，我。

04:22.600 --> 04:23.900
- Hey, where's Squidward?
- 嘿，章鱼哥在哪儿？

04:23.900 --> 04:26.733
I'm sure I saw him in here.
我确信我在这里见过他。

04:26.733 --> 04:28.400
- Well, maybe he fell in the
toilet?
- 好吧，也许他掉进了
厕所？

04:28.400 --> 04:29.767
I'll check.
我会检查一下。

04:32.633 --> 04:35.100
Squidward,
are you in here?
章鱼哥，
你在这儿吗？

04:35.100 --> 04:37.200
Did you fall in?
你掉进去了吗？

04:37.200 --> 04:38.667
Squidward!
章鱼哥！

04:38.667 --> 04:40.867
- Stop serenading me, you sap.
- 别再给我唱小夜曲了，你这个笨蛋。

04:40.867 --> 04:45.733
It's my day off.
Now, go away.
今天是我休息日。
现在，走开。

04:45.733 --> 04:46.567
- Ahh!
- 啊！

04:46.567 --> 04:48.467
- Found him.
- 找到他了。

04:48.467 --> 04:49.967
- Yup, that's him.
- 是的，就是他。

04:49.967 --> 04:52.567
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

04:52.567 --> 04:55.767
- Aliens from Mars!
It's an invasion!
- 来自火星的外星人！
这是入侵！

04:55.767 --> 04:57.200
Waaahhhh!
哇啊啊！

04:57.200 --> 04:58.233
Ugh!
啊!

04:58.233 --> 05:00.533
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:00.533 --> 05:04.767
[shouting]
[喊叫]

05:04.767 --> 05:06.500
both: Whoo-hoo-hoo!
两人：呼呼呼！

05:06.500 --> 05:08.233
Whoooa!
哇哦！

05:08.233 --> 05:11.333
Whoo-whoo!
呼呼！

05:11.333 --> 05:15.267
Whirly Brains are go!
旋转大脑出发了！

05:15.267 --> 05:18.067
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

05:22.300 --> 05:27.200
[both slurping]
[两人都发出咕噜声]

05:27.200 --> 05:28.267
[laughter]
[笑声]

05:28.267 --> 05:31.167
- She spit in his face.
[laughs]
- 她吐口水在他脸上。
[笑]

05:31.167 --> 05:34.900
[both munching]
[两人都在咀嚼]

05:34.900 --> 05:37.933
- Mrs. Puff, we've been dating
for 16 years now,
- 帕芙女士，我们一直在约会
16年来，

05:37.933 --> 05:40.367
so I was sincerely hoping that
today
所以我真诚地希望
今天

05:40.367 --> 05:41.933
might finally be the day that...
也许终于有一天……

05:41.933 --> 05:43.233
- Yes, Eugene?
- 是的，尤金？

05:43.233 --> 05:44.900
- That I steal a little kiss?
- 我偷了一个小吻？

05:44.900 --> 05:46.067
- Oh.
- 哦。

05:46.067 --> 05:49.867
Oh, Eugene, I thought you'd
never ask.
哦，尤金，我以为你会
永远不要问。

05:51.700 --> 05:54.267
- C'mere you.
- 来吧，你。

05:54.267 --> 05:55.833
[both farting]
[都放屁]

05:55.833 --> 05:57.133
- Ohh.
- 哦。

05:57.133 --> 05:58.933
- What a woman.
- 真是个女人啊。

05:58.933 --> 06:01.367
- Oh, Eugene.
- 哦，尤金。

06:01.367 --> 06:03.600
[laughter]
[笑声]

06:03.600 --> 06:07.567
[both farting]
[都放屁]

06:07.567 --> 06:08.833
[laughter]
[笑声]

06:08.833 --> 06:11.067
both: Ow.
What was that?
两人：噢。
那是什么？

06:11.067 --> 06:12.800
- Ooh, that smarts.
- 哦，这很聪明。

06:12.800 --> 06:15.067
[laughs]
Bull's-eye.
[笑]
靶心。

06:15.067 --> 06:17.300
- I thought we were the first
kids on the block
- 我以为我们是第一个
街区里的孩子们

06:17.300 --> 06:19.067
to get Whirly Brains.
获得旋转大脑。

06:19.067 --> 06:20.400
- What are you, thick?
- 你是什么，厚？

06:20.400 --> 06:22.267
Every kid in
town's got a Whirly Brain.
每个孩子在
镇上有一个旋转大脑。

06:22.267 --> 06:24.167
Pssh!
嘘！

06:27.167 --> 06:30.133
- Daddy, Daddy, can I have a
Whirly Brain too?
- 爸爸，爸爸，我可以要一个吗？
还有旋脑？

06:30.133 --> 06:31.767
- Absolutely not, son.
- 绝对不是，儿子。

06:31.767 --> 06:34.300
Your brain is your body's most
important organ, not a toy.
你的大脑是你身体最重要的部分
重要的器官，不是玩具。

06:34.300 --> 06:35.900
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

06:35.900 --> 06:38.467
- Pow!
- [laughs]
- 战俘！
- [笑]

06:38.467 --> 06:40.167
- Hooray!
- 万岁！

06:40.167 --> 06:42.333
Now we can play Whirly Brains
with the whole neighborhood.
现在我们可以玩旋转大脑了
与整个社区。

06:42.333 --> 06:44.600
Hey, kid, race you the end of
the street.
嘿，孩子，和你赛跑到底
街道。

06:44.600 --> 06:47.667
- Eat my brain stem, slowpoke.
- 吃掉我的脑干吧，慢吞吞的。

06:47.667 --> 06:49.667
[all farting]
[全放屁]

06:49.667 --> 06:52.400
- Get ready, get set, punch it.
- 准备好，准备好，出拳。

06:52.400 --> 06:54.667
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

06:54.667 --> 06:56.333
[farting]
[放屁]

06:56.333 --> 06:58.333
[both coughing]
[两人都咳嗽]

06:58.333 --> 07:00.467
- Heh-heh-heh-heh-heh-heh.
- 嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿。

07:00.467 --> 07:02.933
- Ahh! Ohh! Huh?
- 啊！哦！啊？

07:02.933 --> 07:04.533
- Yes!
We're gonna beat him, Patrick.
- 是的！
我们要打败他，帕特里克。

07:04.533 --> 07:06.800
We're gonna win!
我们会赢！

07:09.533 --> 07:12.367
- Fly your toys into my yard,
will you?
- 把你的玩具飞到我的院子里，
你会吗？

07:12.367 --> 07:15.067
Well, they're mine now.
好吧，他们现在是我的了。

07:15.067 --> 07:18.233
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

07:18.233 --> 07:20.467
- Hey, what's going on?
Everything went dark.
- 嘿，怎么了？
一切都变暗了。

07:20.467 --> 07:21.967
Patrick, can you see
anything?
帕特里克，你能看到吗
有什么吗？

07:21.967 --> 07:26.567
- Only the dismal abyss of black
nothingness.
- 只有黑色的惨淡深渊
虚无。

07:26.567 --> 07:28.500
- Oh, our remote controls are
dead too.
- 哦，我们的遥控器是
也死了。

07:28.500 --> 07:31.233
Oh, Patrick, I don't want to
jump to any conclusions here,
哦，帕特里克，我不想
在这里跳到任何结论，

07:31.233 --> 07:34.767
but I think that we have lost
our minds.
但我认为我们已经输了
我们的想法。

07:34.767 --> 07:37.400
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

07:37.400 --> 07:41.467
M-O-O-N.
月亮。

07:41.467 --> 07:43.067
That spells moon.
那拼的是月亮。

07:43.067 --> 07:45.867
[chuckling]
[轻笑]

07:45.867 --> 07:47.467
- Okay, don't panic, Patrick.
- 好吧，别惊慌，帕特里克。

07:47.467 --> 07:49.067
We'll find them.
Just take it easy.
我们会找到他们的。
放轻松吧。

07:49.067 --> 07:51.800
Take it easy.
Patrick, take it easy!
别紧张。
帕特里克，放轻松！

07:51.800 --> 07:54.200
- I'm taking it easy, SpongeBob.
- 我很轻松，海绵宝宝。

07:54.200 --> 07:56.433
- Our brains are probably right
around here somewhere.
- 我们的大脑可能是对的
就在这附近的某个地方。

07:56.433 --> 07:58.267
Here, brains.
Brains.
在这里，大脑。
大脑。

07:58.267 --> 07:59.733
Here, boy.
在这里，男孩。

07:59.733 --> 08:01.367
- Here, brains.
- 在这里，大脑。

08:01.367 --> 08:03.733
- Brainy, where are you?
- 聪明，你在哪里？

08:03.733 --> 08:05.467
- Brain, brain, brain.
- 大脑，大脑，大脑。

08:05.467 --> 08:07.800
I think I found it, SpongeBob.
我想我找到了，海绵宝宝。

08:07.800 --> 08:09.867
- I found mine too.
- 我也找到了我的。

08:09.867 --> 08:11.733
Aw, darn it.
I still can't see.
噢，该死。
我还是看不清。

08:11.733 --> 08:16.367
- Yeah, and my brain won't fit
back in.
- 是的，我的大脑不适应
回来。

08:16.367 --> 08:17.767
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

08:17.767 --> 08:19.700
- Oh, uh, ma'am,
you forgot something.
- 哦，呃，女士，
你忘记了什么。

08:19.700 --> 08:21.567
- That's okay.
You can keep it.
- 没关系。
你可以保留它。

08:21.567 --> 08:24.767
- I'll take it.
- 我要买它。

08:24.767 --> 08:27.667
Oh, yeah, looking good.
哦，是的，看起来不错。

08:27.667 --> 08:29.067
- Ew.
Gimme that.
- 呃。
给我那个。

08:29.067 --> 08:32.233
- Aw, man, that felt all
squishy.
- 噢，伙计，这就是我的感觉
软软的。

08:32.233 --> 08:33.667
[laughs]
[笑]

08:33.667 --> 08:35.900
- Patrick, we need help.
Let's call Sandy.
- 帕特里克，我们需要帮助。
我们打电话给桑迪吧。

08:35.900 --> 08:38.333
- Okay.
Sandy!
- 好的。
沙！

08:38.333 --> 08:41.233
- Patrick, I meant on the phone.
- 帕特里克，我是说在电话里。

08:41.233 --> 08:42.433
- Hello?
- 你好？

08:42.433 --> 08:45.233
both: Sandy!
两人：桑迪！

08:45.233 --> 08:46.367
- Dang.
- 当当。

08:46.367 --> 08:48.067
You two sure are lucky I
created this
